# ==============================================================
# OCEAN PUZZLE - FORGET YOUR SONG (12 of 12)
# ==============================================================
# Script type : interact
# Bind to     : 11444 161 10999 (the Forget block)
# Map/area    : [FILL IN: map name / room]
# Import      : /s i i <paste URL>, then click the head
#
# What it does:
#   For players who solved Room 1 but didn't write down their
#   notes (which Room 4 needs). After typing "forget" in chat to
#   confirm, the player gets a NEW song and Room 1 becomes
#   unsolved, so they re-solve Room 1 (hearts and all) and can
#   note the positions this time. Room 3 stays solved (its
#   answer never changes). Any Room 4 melody progress is cleared.
#   If the player is on a team, they leave it: their online
#   teammates are told right away and keep their own song.
#   Since they're unsolved again, they can make or join a new
#   team at the Team Conduit (joining a team un-solves Room 3
#   for the whole team, as usual).
#   Does nothing for players who haven't solved Room 1.
#
# Placement note: in Room 1, where players returning from the
#   later rooms will find it. Typing anything other than
#   "forget", or waiting 20 seconds, cancels.
#
# Requires: puzzle1 namespace (see Submit script header)
# Related scripts: Submit (1), Reset (4), Team Conduit (6),
#   Symbols (7), Instrument (10)
# ==============================================================
@using puzzle1
@if !solved || answer == ""
@player &3Oracle: &bYou have no song yet to forget...
@return
@fi
@define String word = ""
@player &3Oracle: &bWould you cast your song back into the deep? It will not return, and the elders will compose you another.
@player &7&o[Note] This gives you a new song and un-solves Room 1 (Room 3 stays solved). If you're on a team, you'll leave it. Type "forget" in chat to confirm.
@prompt 20s word §3Oracle: §bThe waters still. Your song remains your own.
@if word.trim().toLowerCase() != "forget"
@player &3Oracle: &bThe waters still. Your song remains your own.
@return
@fi
# --- Leave the team: tell the rest right away, regroup them without this player ---
@if team != ""
@define String me = player.getUniqueId()
@define String rest = ""
@define Player q = player
@for String id in team_members.split(",")
@if id != me
@var q = Player(id)
@if q != null
@if team[q] == team && q.isOnline()
@if rest != ""
@var rest = rest + ","
@fi
@var rest = rest + id
@fi
@fi
@fi
@done
@if rest != ""
@define String restId = team + "~" + "{{system::currentTimeMillis() / 1000L}}"
@define Boolean alone = !rest.contains(",")
@for String id in rest.split(",")
@var q = Player(id)
@if q != null
@if alone
@var team[q] = ""
@var team_members[q] = ""
@var q.sendMessage("§7§o[Note] {{player.getName()}} has forgotten their song and left your team. You are now playing solo.")
@else
@var team[q] = restId
@var team_members[q] = rest
@var q.sendMessage("§7§o[Note] {{player.getName()}} has forgotten their song and left your team.")
@fi
@fi
@done
@fi
@var team = ""
@var team_members = ""
@player &7&o[Note] You have left your team.
@fi
# --- New song; Room 1 unsolved again ---
@define Int[] pool = list::range(0, 25)
@var pool.shuffle()
@define String[] notes = String[]
@for Int i in list::range(0, 10)
@var notes.append(String(pool[i]))
@done
@var answer = notes.join(",")
@var solved = false
@var solved4 = false
@var inst_started_at = 0L
@var inst_seq = ""
@player &3Oracle: &bThe deep takes back your song... and the elders sing you another. Mark it well this time.
